-> Transformer organelle: handles TransformRequest particles
TransformRequest = Particle ∩ { _class ∈ "TransformRequest", input ∈ String, operation ∈ String }
TransformResult = Particle ∩ { _class ∈ "TransformResult", input ∈ String, operation ∈ String }

TransformRequest => {
    return TransformResult { input = input, operation = operation }
}
